Files containing Apache Kafka material. Each starts with an attribution header stating
that it was modified, and marks every ported part `// Ported from:` with its source:

- crates/alluvium-types/src/partitioner.rs: murmur2, ported from
  clients/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/common/utils/Utils.java; and the test vectors
  of clients/src/test/java/org/apache/kafka/common/utils/UtilsTest.java (testMurmur2).
- crates/alluvium-types/src/uuid.rs: tests ported from
  clients/src/test/java/org/apache/kafka/common/UuidTest.java.
- crates/alluvium-types/src/topic.rs: tests ported from
  clients/src/test/java/org/apache/kafka/common/internals/TopicTest.java.
- crates/alluvium-protocol/src/varint.rs: tests ported from
  clients/src/test/java/org/apache/kafka/common/utils/internals/ByteUtilsTest.java
  (the varint and varlong cases).
- xtask/src/message_spec/versions.rs: tests ported from
  generator/src/test/java/org/apache/kafka/message/VersionsTest.java.
- xtask/src/message_spec/spec.rs: tests ported from
  generator/src/test/java/org/apache/kafka/message/StructSpecTest.java,
  generator/src/test/java/org/apache/kafka/message/EntityTypeTest.java and
  generator/src/test/java/org/apache/kafka/message/MessageDataGeneratorTest.java
  (the invalid-schema cases).
- xtask/src/codegen.rs: tests ported from
  generator/src/test/java/org/apache/kafka/message/MessageGeneratorTest.java
  (testToSnakeCase, testGenerateAndWriteMessageClasses).
- xtask/src/message_spec/registry.rs: tests ported from
  generator/src/test/java/org/apache/kafka/message/StructRegistryTest.java.

Files generated from Apache Kafka material by `cargo xtask codegen`. Each starts with a
header naming the Kafka file it was generated from:

- crates/alluvium-protocol/src/generated/: from schemas/kafka-4.4.0/clients/, with
  each schema's `about` text, edited for rustdoc, as doc comments; and error_code.rs,
  from schemas/kafka-4.4.0/errors/Errors.java, with Kafka's default error messages.
- crates/alluvium-protocol/src/test_messages/: from schemas/kafka-4.4.0/clients-test/.
- docs/errors.md: from schemas/kafka-4.4.0/errors/Errors.java, with Kafka's default
  error messages.

Data read from Apache Kafka's released client jar by `cargo xtask schemas dump-errors`:

- xtask/tests/fixtures/kafka-4.4.0-errors.json: the error table of kafka-clients 4.4.0
  (names, codes and default messages), the golden file for the generated error codes.

Apache Kafka files copied unmodified, with Kafka's own LICENSE and NOTICE beside them:

- schemas/kafka-4.4.0/: the message schemas of Apache Kafka 4.4.0, and the Java sources
  of its error codes and exception classes (see its README.md for the source directory
  of each subdirectory).
